      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Message outbox\nWebhook **ce-dispatch_outbound_message** (responseMode=lastNode).\n\n1. SMTP credential **CoreEngine SMTP** on both **Send email** nodes.\n2. Env: `BFF_URL`, `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `CRM_N8N_*`, optional `SMTP_FROM`.\n3. **Is Draft?** If draft → PATCH `is_draft=false` and stop (CoreEngine queue/dispatch automations send once). If not draft → continue (retry / send-now).\n4. Type **Email** → SMTP. On SMTP error → **Mark failed** → rethrow.\n5. Other types stub → Mark sent.\n6. After Mark sent: if `to_user` set → **Create incoming_message** (always new; owner=`to_user`) via BFF REST — no BFF special-case code.\n7. Settings → Error workflow → failed-execution-alert.\n8. Repo JSON is source of truth — re-export after UI edits.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
